{"3835100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starnded: Gardens of the Rubellite", "steam_appid": 3835100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Starnded: Gardens of the Rubellite</strong></i> is a first-person survival RPG on an alien world where there are no guns, and every encounter is decided by movement, timing, and survival skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/ed31a88b7bfe8f07b2d905a2e47bab0e.avif?t=1787854457\" width=1096 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before disaster struck, Earth’s nations launched one last desperate mission: send thousands of capable people to a habitable world. With the old systems collapsing, survival became the only currency. Those who built the colony ships, cryopods, and life-support systems earned a single reward - a frozen ticket to a new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/6c281c115cde55d511190ca3ad6d85b4.poster.avif?t=1787854457\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/6c281c115cde55d511190ca3ad6d85b4.webm?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/6c281c115cde55d511190ca3ad6d85b4.mp4?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your cryopod opens the moment you start the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First survivors have built various safe zones and camps. But Sara-376c is not as pretty as they were promised - it is far more dangerous than they initially thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/a8afc1cc3454f37dd5fd82cd8dddb838.poster.avif?t=1787854457\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/a8afc1cc3454f37dd5fd82cd8dddb838.webm?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/a8afc1cc3454f37dd5fd82cd8dddb838.mp4?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/c022bf99d4aba93eebd97b4fa7148b9c.webp?t=1787854457\" width=957 height=62 /></span><strong>Rubellite Gardens</strong> is a vibrant wilderness filled with  pink vegetation, alien wildlife, abandoned survivor camps, mysterious structures, and the remains of those who arrived before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/064581e54be684e5217cf83c69ef24c8.poster.avif?t=1787854457\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/064581e54be684e5217cf83c69ef24c8.webm?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/064581e54be684e5217cf83c69ef24c8.mp4?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/a334cdea4e592f40bbc05b38c8d60ed1.avif?t=1787854457\" width=869 height=66 /></span>Forget the usual survival formula. There are no guns on Sara-376c. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter rewards movement, positioning, timing, and experience instead of whoever fires the first shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/50dc5a6603727b5e65ef00c71a3848ae.poster.avif?t=1787854457\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/50dc5a6603727b5e65ef00c71a3848ae.webm?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/50dc5a6603727b5e65ef00c71a3848ae.mp4?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/2be9be1ff052e0b1883a002d552167c0.webp?t=1787854457\" width=952 height=62 /></span>Build a base to protect your loot and secure your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim resource-rich territory for convenience, or build deep in the forest where only a few survivors will think to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/137e66d6b4d4d41ac1fe11500a126dcf.poster.avif?t=1787854457\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/137e66d6b4d4d41ac1fe11500a126dcf.webm?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/137e66d6b4d4d41ac1fe11500a126dcf.mp4?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/b47016a7bc2cbfd9e68366bfd9240f6b.webp?t=1787854457\" width=758 height=63 /></span>Play alone, form alliances, trade, raid, or betray others when the opportunity arises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter can change your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/9319bc815911b021f48161d6a5b8694a.poster.avif?t=1787854457\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/9319bc815911b021f48161d6a5b8694a.webm?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835100/extras/9319bc815911b021f48161d6a5b8694a.mp4?t=1787854457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪐 Handcrafted open world filled with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏃 Fast-paced movement-focused combat without firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ Build and defend your own base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👽 Strange alien wildlife and mysterious ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Multiplayer, PvP, PvE and solo play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 Environmental storytelling with no quest markers or cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Release: 2026, Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The first phase takes place 